236
00:25:58,907 --> 00:26:06,296
[SPEAKER_04]: So, the virtue and the sense restraints, in this case, provide sort of a scaffolding for you to hold on to, that it doesn't become too much.

237
00:26:07,404 --> 00:26:15,988
