00:27:37,967 --> 00:27:47,153
[SPEAKER_02]: That attempt to outrun the anxiety, the natural uncertainty of the aggregates, manifests through these actions of sensuality and all that.

248
00:27:47,193 --> 00:27:57,479
[SPEAKER_02]: But then, when death comes, and you can't even move anymore, then all of that stuff that you would be kind of letting out into the world, you can't anymore.

