00:28:02,494 --> 00:28:02,714
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

252
00:28:03,055 --> 00:28:19,365
[SPEAKER_02]: So, that's where... that's why it's important, because then, that makes it so that... virtue and sense restraint makes it so that, no matter how much of that internal discomfort and pressure you come up with,

