[SPEAKER_02]: In fact, the body, when people are projected into these externals, that's exactly why they end up conceiving the body as another kind of external thing, like just the outside shell of, you know, sensations or things that I can directly perceive, not realizing that the body is actually much more fundamental than that.

345
00:37:34,004 --> 00:37:38,945
[SPEAKER_00]: So, you would actually have to withdraw yourself from these things to recognize

