00:37:39,665 --> 00:37:49,290
[SPEAKER_00]: What that more fundamental dependence is, which would ultimately make death be uncomfortable.

347
00:37:49,330 --> 00:37:54,553
[SPEAKER_00]: Because if you're not holding on to any of these things, again, not as a matter of choice, but as a matter of

