[SPEAKER_04]: They might make things externally more comfortable even, and one can just fall asleep in a little corner in your kuti somewhere, entirely missing the point.

367
00:39:57,338 --> 00:40:12,247
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, so the virtue would only prepare you for death, if it's taken on that right level, with the recognition of how, through this, these things that would make death

